  <content>
    <section>
      <title>Activity</title>
      <note>
        <para>Access the <link url="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/b62c9150250bf52d6cc37569213ab516e0090dca">Desmos guide PDF</link> for tips on solving problems with the Desmos graphing calculator.</para>
      
      <para>Watch the following video to help you answer the questions below.</para>
      <media alt="Placeholder for Alt Text">
        <iframe width="660" height="371.4" src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/304121358"/>
      </media>
      <!--Q#1-->
      
        <exercise>
          <problem>
            <para>To complete the table, record the weight for the number of oranges in the box from the video.</para>
